      "skos:scopeNote": "PHC handbook glossary wording under 'Deploy' (who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md, p. 8). Wording alternative in SC handbook glossary under 'deployment' (who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8): \"Making a software system available for use beyond testing purposes.\" Both are recorded as candidates; neither is chosen (smart-ra#133 S1).",
